# Wave W17-J (Route 46): ridge post — a weathered ridge waymark post, a stout post with a crossbar and a small hanging board, a cairn of ridge stones piled at its foot against the wind, on high turf (fully opaque, ground baked in). The high road’s markers stand where the ridge turns.
